  "articleBody": "Before requesting bedroom addition proposals, define how the room will function, verify the property’s constraints, gather existing records, and compare complete scopes rather than isolated construction prices. Plans may need to address foundation, framing, roof and exterior connections, electrical service, heating and cooling, windows, alarms, finishes, permits, inspections, and any bathroom or storage included in the project.",
  "datePublished": "2026-11-11"
